# Build context trimming for the mcpjam-inspector/Dockerfile image.
#
# Everything this file excludes is NOT copied by any stage of
# mcpjam-inspector/Dockerfile, so removing it from the context cannot change
# the built image. The excluded paths are the bulk of the tree: ~32 MB of
# documentation screenshots, the GitHub automation, and internal notes.
#
# Do NOT add any of these without checking the Dockerfile's COPY list first:
# the build reads package.json/package-lock.json for all 13 workspaces, plus
# the full source of evaluators, sdk, cli, design-system, chat-ui,
# widget-react, mcpjam-inspector, soundcheck, mcp, slack-app, surface-core and
# discord-app (vitest contributes only its package.json).

.git
.github
docs
notes

# Workspace build output — every one of these is produced inside the image.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/out
**/.vite

.DS_Store
*.log
